=== BREAK-EVEN: what kills the maker branch ===
  edge on filled, observed = 0.002298043 | shrunk = -0.00128367662
  spread level that zeroes the SHRUNK filled edge: 0.00371632338 (current median spread 0.005)
  adverse-selection ratio (filled/all): observed 0.436618 | shrunk -1.76384
  NOTE the correct reading of 'break-even fill share': an unfilled limit order neither
  earns nor costs, so a lower fill share does not flip the SIGN of the per-attempt edge;
  it scales POWER. The branch dies not from a low fill share but from adverse selection
  inside the filled subset, which is already measured above.

